#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:325
msgid "Current Activity, Threaded"
msgstr "Aktuell Aktiviteet mit Klöönsnacks"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:326
msgid ""
"This view uses smart date range groups. Messages are threaded. So for "
"example, in \"Today\" you will find all the messages arrived today and all "
"the threads that have been active today."
msgstr ""
"Disse Ansicht bruukt plietsch Datumrebeet-Koppeln, Narichten warrt as "
"Klöönsnacks wiest. Binnen \"Vundaag\" schallst Du also all niege Narichten "
"finnen, un ok all Klöönsnacks, binnen de sik vundaag wat daan hett."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:342
msgid "Current Activity, Flat"
msgstr "Aktuell Aktiviteet, flach"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:343
msgid ""
"This view uses smart date range groups. Messages are not threaded. So for "
"example, in \"Today\" you will simply find all the messages arrived today."
msgstr ""
"Disse Ansicht bruukt plietsch Datumrebeet-Koppeln, Narichten warrt nich as "
"Klöönsnacks wiest. Binnen \"Vundaag\" schallst Du also all Narichten finnen, "
"de vundaag ankamen sünd."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:358
msgid "Activity by Date, Threaded"
msgstr "Aktiviteet na Datum, mit Klöönsnacks"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:359
msgid ""
"This view uses day-by-day groups. Messages are threaded. So for example, in "
"\"Today\" you will find all the messages arrived today and all the threads "
"that have been active today."
msgstr ""
"Disse Ansicht bruukt Enkeldag-Koppeln, Narichten warrt as Klöönsnacks wiest. "
"Binnen \"Vundaag\" schallst Du also all niege Narichten finnen, un ok all "
"Klöönsnacks, binnen de sik vundaag wat daan hett."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:375
msgid "Activity by Date, Flat"
msgstr "Aktiviteet na Datum, flach"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:376
msgid ""
"This view uses day-by-day groups. Messages are not threaded. So for example, "
"in \"Today\" you will simply find all the messages arrived today."
msgstr ""
"Disse Ansicht bruukt Enkeldag-Koppeln, Narichten warrt nich as Klöönsnacks "
"wiest. Binnen \"Vundaag\" schallst Du also all Narichten finnen, de vundaag "
"ankamen sünd."

